{"availability":"available","full":"Irash-Perera/EduGenius","name":"EduGenius","description":"EduGenius is an innovative AI-powered tutoring platform addressing challenges in modern education by offering personalized and efficient tutoring for O/Level students in mathematics.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":8,"forks":1,"created":"2024-06-30T07:37:10Z","updated":"2026-07-26T06:01:13Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://edugenius.streamlit.app/","topics":["ai","chromadb","dse","education","educational-project","edugenus","gemini","langchain","multimodal","rag","streamlit","wolfram"],"demo":"https://edugenius.streamlit.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:24:46.805Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:24:46.805Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:24:46.805Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T16:32:54.152Z","stars":8,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-08T21:24:46.805Z","stars":8,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["EduGenius is an innovative AI-powered tutoring platform developed by us who are three undergraduates at the Department of Computer Science and Engineering, University of Moratuwa, as our Semester 5 project.","The platform addresses challenges in modern education by offering personalized and efficient tutoring for O/Level students in mathematics. Leveraging advanced technologies such as LangChain and pre-processed mathematics marking schemes stored in a vector database, EduGenius generates tailored tutoring materials and provides instant, real-time feedback and grading. This approach enhances the learning experience, empowering students with a more interactive and supportive learning environment."],"features":["User Registration & Login: Users can register and log in using their email addresses. Password recovery is also supported.","Math Problem Solving: Students can select math problems, submit their answers via images or canvas input, and receive immediate feedback.","Hints & Tips: If students get stuck, they can request hints from the system.","Feedback & Scoring: EduGenius provides feedback on students' answers and scores them based on correctness.","Question Clarification: Students can ask questions related to the problems and get clarifications from the system."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Irash-Perera/EduGenius/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b6a834319fe4020437bbac8189246333c44b75c74d3d7884fb7aeb404fed89bf","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T16:32:54.534Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:32:54.534Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"EduGenius is an innovative AI-powered tutoring platform developed by us who are three undergraduates at the Department of Computer Science and Engineering, University of Moratuwa, as our Semester 5 project.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Irash-Perera/EduGenius/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"User Registration & Login: Users can register and log in using their email addresses.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Irash-Perera/EduGenius/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b6a834319fe4020437bbac8189246333c44b75c74d3d7884fb7aeb404fed89bf","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Irash-Perera/EduGenius/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T16:32:54.535Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-26T06:01:13Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Irash-Perera/EduGenius/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T16:32:54.535Z","hash":"b6a834319fe4020437bbac8189246333c44b75c74d3d7884fb7aeb404fed89bf","originalBytes":3109,"storedBytes":3109,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["edugenius","students","feedback","tutoring","math","their","using","assets","clone","command","dive","following","install","let","platform","quick","run","screenshots","tour","user","users","answers","application","dependencies","features","get","hints","learning","past","platform.","problem","probl